{
  "name": "frog",
  "_about": "SCULPTED (2026-11-05, docs/engines.md 'the sculpt overlay'): a common frog sitting, 10 cm snout to vent -- the trunk tilted up at the shoulders over a sacral hump, a wide flat head with the mouth line running back under a dark mask to the tympanum, bulging gold eyes with horizontal pupils, pale dorsolateral ridges, short forelegs with the hands turned in, the hind legs folded in a Z (thigh forward, shank back, the long foot forward again) on splayed webbed toes; dark spots over an olive-green back, a cream belly || COATS AND VARIANTS (2026-11-06): params spots (the dark patches), ridges (the pale dorsolateral ridges and the lid line), mask (the dark mask behind the eye), stripe (a tree frog's dark side stripe, edged pale), midline (a pool frog's pale line down the spine), bands (a dart frog's yellow bands), flankBars (a red-eyed tree frog's pale bars on its blue flanks), pupilBar / pupilSlit (horizontal, vertical; neither: round), tympS (the eardrum's size); colours limb (arms and feet, else side), leg (thighs and shanks, else back), toe (fingers and toes, else limb), stripe, stripeEdge, midline, band, bar. The markings are PAINTS (op paint: colour only). Coats: the European ones the game picks from; variants: the exotic ones (asset manager only)",
